      "id": "sol.amc-12b-2021-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(3\\pi \\approx 9.42,\\) the inequality \\(|x| \\lt 3\\pi\\) means \\(-9.42 \\lt x \\lt 9.42.\\)\n\nThe integers in this range run from \\(-9\\) to \\(9,\\) giving \\(19\\) values.\n\nThus, the correct answer is D.",
      "hints": [
        "\\(3\\pi\\) is a little more than \\(9\\)",
        "Count the integers from \\(-9\\) to \\(9\\) inclusive"
